[en.FOCUS_C01_SMILE]
Smile!

[en.FOCUS_C01_SMILE_desc]
Living in the Great Jahr Null, it is impossible for the average citizen of the Empire to not feel happy. If a pony does not have a smile on their face, it can only be understood as a slander against the achievements of the Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_SMILE]
笑容！

[zh.FOCUS_C01_SMILE_desc]
生活在伟大的新元年，帝国的普通公民是不可能感受不到幸福的，如果有的小马脸上没有笑容，只能理解为其对帝国所取得成就的诋毁。

